[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Tired and Thirsty]
[00:00.76]Lesson 19 | 第19课
[00:02.55]Tired and thirsty | 又累又渴
[00:05.60]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.58]Why do the children thank their mother? | 孩子们为什么感谢他们的妈妈？
[00:16.81]What's the matter children? | 孩子们，怎么了？
[00:20.42]We're tired ... | 我们累了……
[00:22.57]... and thirsty Mum. | ……而且渴了，妈妈。
[00:24.91]Sit down here. | 坐到这儿来。
[00:27.34]Are you all right now? | 你们现在好了吗？
[00:29.92]No we aren't. | 不，我们没有。
[00:32.24]Look! | 看！
[00:33.45]There's an ice cream man. | 有个卖冰淇淋的。
[00:36.49]Two ice cream please. | 请来两个冰淇淋。
[00:39.92]Here you are children. | 孩子们，给你们。
[00:43.14]Thanks Mum. | 谢谢妈妈。
[00:45.69]These ice creams are nice. | 这些冰淇淋真好吃。
[00:49.36]Are you all right now? | 你们现在好了吗？
[00:52.30]Yes we are thank you! | 是的，我们好了，谢谢！